window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>In a Las Vegas ruled by the shadows, Fallon O'Sullivan leads a ruthless Irish vampire syndicate, clashing constantly with his equally dangerous rival, hitman Magic McCullen. These are the true princes of Paradise, their empire built on greed, prostitution, money laundering, and death.</p> <p>But even a king has a weakness. For Fallon, it's Nova, a spirited, silver-haired waitress who stands barely four feet eleven. As these two powerful vampire gangsters battle for control of the city, their sights turn to Nova. Will either succeed in winning her heart, or will she become another casualty in their deadly game?</p> <p>The saga continues in Louisiana, at the Magical World of the Black Lotus Casino. Explore The McCullen Clan History, where a wedding, a murder, and revenge intertwine with sex, lies, spells, tarot, and time travel. In this world of dark magic and ancient rivalries, the ultimate question remains: Who truly holds the power?</p>"; 
